Hi {Owner},

I build websites for massage therapists and bodywork studios around {City}. {Business Name} has warm reviews on Google, but no site where a new client can read which modality to book, what a session costs and what happens at the first visit.

I built a sample first rather than ask for your time: a modality guide, session lengths and prices, a pressure and draping page for first-timers, and memberships, with marked placeholders where your photos would go:

{demo-link}

If you want it, I move it to a domain you own and finish it for {Build Range}, plus {Care Range} a month for hosting and menu changes. If not, no problem, it comes down at the end of the month.

Worth ten minutes between clients?

{Your Name}
{Your Studio} · {Your Phone}
{Your Physical Address}

